OL,3,GNEWSALack of learning disability nurses
OL,4,Aas numbers fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university says it is struggling to
OL,7,Frecruit student nurses specialising in
OL,8,Flearning disabilities and the situation
OL,9,Fhas been "challenging nationally for a
OL,10,Fnumber of years".
OL,12,FThe University of the West of England
OL,13,F(UWE) has temporarily paused
OL,14,Frecruitment to its Nursing (Learning
OL,15,FDisabilities) degree.
OL,17,FProgramme lead and senior lecturer
OL,18,FCraig Boothroyd said a key aspect was
OL,19,Fthat many prospective students were
OL,20,Funaware the specialism existed as a
OL,21,Fdistinct field of nursing.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
