OL,3,GNEWSALack of learning disability nurses
OL,4,Aas numbers fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FJonathan Beebee, a registered learning
OL,7,Fdisability nurse, said the need for the
OL,8,Frole was increasing and there was an
OL,9,Furgent need to make the specialism "a
OL,10,Flot clearer and more visible"
OL,11,Fespecially to those who had never heard
OL,12,Fof it.
